# GPU name rules (Linux: names from pci.ids / lspci).
#
# match|action|pattern|text
#
# Every row whose 'match' fits the original name is applied, top to bottom.
# 'match' and 'pattern' are shell globs, case-insensitive; write \[ and \(
# for a literal bracket. A name that fits no row isn't shown.
#
#   del      remove every 'pattern'
#   sub      replace every 'pattern' with 'text'
#   inner    keep only the text inside the last [brackets]
#   keep     protect the first 'pattern' from the rules below
#   default  use 'text' if nothing is left of the name
#   brand    put 'text' in front unless the name has it. 'pattern' is
#            optional: the original name has to fit it. First one wins.
#   type     'text' is dedicated or integrated, for --gpu_type. Last one
#            wins. Without it, Intel is integrated and the rest dedicated.
#
# './neofetch-edit try gpu "<name>"' shows what a name turns into.

# AMD: 'Advanced Micro Devices, Inc. [AMD/ATI] Navi 23 [Radeon RX 6600]'
Advanced Micro Devices*|del|\[AMD/ATI\]|
Advanced Micro Devices*|del|\[AMD\]|
Advanced Micro Devices*|del|OEM |
Advanced Micro Devices*|del|Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.|
Advanced Micro Devices*|inner||
Advanced Micro Devices*|brand|*AMD*ATI*|AMD ATI
Advanced Micro Devices*|brand||AMD

# NVIDIA: 'NVIDIA Corporation GA102 [GeForce RTX 3080]'
NVIDIA*|del|Corporation|
NVIDIA*|inner||
NVIDIA*|brand||NVIDIA

# Intel: 'Intel Corporation DG2 [Arc A770]',
#        'Intel Corporation Meteor Lake-P [Intel Arc Graphics]',
#        'Intel Corporation HD Graphics 6000'
Intel*|del|Corporation|
Intel*|del|\(R\)|
Intel*|del|\(TM\)|
Intel*|inner||
Intel*|sub|*Intel|Intel
Intel*|del| \(*|
Intel*|del|Integrated Graphics Controller|
Intel*|sub|*Xeon*|Intel HD Graphics
Intel*|default||Intel Integrated Graphics
Intel*|brand||Intel

# Intel cards (Arc A/B series, Arc Pro, Iris Xe MAX) are dedicated; the
# 'Arc Graphics' built into Core Ultra (... Lake) chips is not.
Intel*DG[12] *|type||dedicated
Intel*Battlemage*|type||dedicated
Intel*Arc [AB][0-9]*|type||dedicated
Intel*Arc Pro*|type||dedicated
Intel*Iris Xe MAX*|type||dedicated
Intel*Lake*|type||integrated

*MCST*|sub|*MCST*MGA2*|MCST MGA2
*VirtualBox*|sub|*|VirtualBox Graphics Adapter
